; Checks the reader rejects OpVectorShuffle when the OpTypeVectorIdEXT result
; component count differs from the number of selected components.

; RUN: not llvm-spirv -spirv-text -r %s -o %t.bc 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

; CHECK: VectorShuffle: result component count must match the number of components selected

119734787 66304 458752 11 0
2 Capability Addresses
2 Capability Linkage
2 Capability Kernel
6 Extension "SPV_EXT_long_vector"
3 MemoryModel 2 2
3 Source 3 102000
3 Name 1 "f"

5 Decorate 1 LinkageAttributes "f" Export
4 TypeInt 3 32 0
4 Constant 3 4 5
3 TypeFloat 2 32
4 TypeVectorIdEXT 5 2 4
5 TypeFunction 6 5 5 5

5 Function 5 1 0 6
3 FunctionParameter 5 7
3 FunctionParameter 5 8

2 Label 9
8 VectorShuffle 5 10 7 8 0 1 2
2 ReturnValue 10

1 FunctionEnd
